        "title": {
          "en": "New LLM Architectures Reduce Long-Context Processing Costs",
          "zh": "新LLM架构降低长上下文处理成本"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Recent developments in LLM architectures, including KV Sharing, mHC, and Compressed Attention, are being implemented in models like Gemma 4 and DeepSeek V4 to reduce costs associated with long-context processing.",
          "zh": "大型语言模型（LLM）的最新架构发展，包括KV共享、mHC和压缩注意力，正被Gemma 4和DeepSeek V4等模型采用，以降低长上下文处理的相关成本。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "New LLM architectures feature KV Sharing.",
            "Techniques include mHC (multi-head attention with compression).",
            "Compressed Attention is employed to optimize processing."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "新的LLM架构采用KV共享技术。",
            "技术包括mHC（带压缩的多头注意力）。",
            "为优化处理，模型采用了压缩注意力。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "These architectural advancements address a key challenge in large language models by making long-context processing more cost-effective, which can expand their practical application and scalability.",
          "zh": "这些架构进步解决了大型语言模型中的一个关键挑战，通过提高长上下文处理的成本效益，有助于扩展其实际应用和可扩展性。"
        },
        "source": "Ahead of AI",
        "link": "https://magazine.sebastianraschka.com/p/recent-developments-in-llm-architectures"
      },
